    {
      "version": "1.0.1",
      "createdAt": 1783449710170,
      "changelog": "dlazy-picture-book 1.0.1 — picture book creation workflow and usage clarified\n\n- Provides a clear end-to-end workflow: theme confirmation, story writing, illustration generation (with style consistency), background music, and HTML assembly.\n- Defaults added for page count (10), audience age (3–6), art style (warm watercolor), and protagonist consistency.\n- Step-by-step instructions for generating and assembling a portable, offline HTML picture book (with illustrations, text, and background music).\n- Detailed authentication and API key guidance for dLazy CLI usage included.\n- Sample book.json structure and folder output provided for quick reference.\n- Emphasizes workflow order to ensure coordinated story, images, and sound.",
      "changelogSource": "auto"
